abstract: >-
  Reproducible research artifact for leakage-safe IoT telemetry evaluation,
  standards traceability, UML/XMI-based evidence management, auditable security
  risk scoring, and cost-aware control portfolio optimization aligned with
  ISO/IEC 27001:2022 and NIST CSF 2.0.
